s one to three days of installation after the planks sit in the house for a day or two. Leveling, tile removal or toilet and appliance work can add a day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What wear layer should I buy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For bedrooms and low-traffic rooms, 12 mil is fine. For kitchens, entries and homes with dogs or kids, look at 20 mil or thicker. Manufacturer warranties vary by product, so read the terms for residential use before you choose."}}]}</script><!-- First-touch attribution. Runs before anything else so a click-id is never
